    "summary": "Store health is process-wide (shared health word with compare-and-swap; every reader in src/db/graph/store.ts goes through currentHealth()) and the full locks-lost record travels through the hub (src/daemon/threads/store-health-hub.ts: wireWorkerStoreHealth sends a worker's record to the main thread and takes pushes; wireMainStoreHealth keeps it and pushes it to every worker). Fixing the previous gate's finding, the hub test now buffers every worker message from the start, so a message sent before the test waits for it is never lost; it passed five runs in a row, and the worker-never-sends and main-never-fans-out mutations each fail it within 3 s.",
